    <briefdescription>
<para>Statistics for the most recent HTTP request issued by <ref refid="classthemis_1_1modules_1_1_remote_registry_client" kindref="compound">RemoteRegistryClient</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Populated by both httpGet() and httpGetBinary() so callers can inspect retry counts and error details without relying on log output.</para>
<para>Wave D (observability): <computeroutput>retry_exhausted_count</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>timeout_count</computeroutput> accumulate across the client&apos;s lifetime for exporter reliability tracking. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
